WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:06.352
Thump! Thump! Thump!

2
00:00:06.353 --> 00:00:08.933
The ogre's footsteps shook the house.

3
00:00:08.934 --> 00:00:11.386
The footsteps grew louder.

4
00:00:11.387 --> 00:00:14.327
The ogre's wife looked worried.

5
00:00:14.328 --> 00:00:24.645
"Quick!" she whispered to Jack. "Hide!"

6
00:00:24.646 --> 00:00:34.069
Just as before, Jack jumped into the oven.

7
00:00:34.070 --> 00:00:37.021
Thump! Thump! Thump!

8
00:00:37.022 --> 00:00:40.405
The ogre stomped into the room.

9
00:00:40.406 --> 00:00:48.219
Instantly he began sniffing around.

10
00:00:48.220 --> 00:00:53.411
"Fee, fi, fo, fum!" the ogre shouted.

11
00:00:53.412 --> 00:00:55.367
"I smell an—"

12
00:00:55.368 --> 00:00:59.268
"It's nothing, dear!" His wife cut him off.

13
00:00:59.269 --> 00:01:03.241
"Here. Eat your breakfast."

14
00:01:03.242 --> 00:01:07.412
The ogre's wife set down some pancakes.

15
00:01:07.413 --> 00:01:09.998
"Fine!" the ogre snapped.

16
00:01:09.999 --> 00:01:12.243
"But I can smell an . . . "

17
00:01:12.244 --> 00:01:16.140
The ogre’s wife sprinkled some blueberries on the pancakes.

18
00:01:16.141 --> 00:01:18.438
The ogre looked down at his plate.

19
00:01:18.439 --> 00:01:29.100
"Ooh!" he cried. "Blueberries!"

20
00:01:29.101 --> 00:01:40.231
Jack peeked out as the ogre ate the pancakes.

21
00:01:40.232 --> 00:01:44.819
After breakfast the ogre patted his belly.

22
00:01:44.820 --> 00:01:46.909
Then he slapped the table.

23
00:01:46.910 --> 00:01:52.745
"Wife!" he shouted. "Bring me my golden hen!"

24
00:01:52.746 --> 00:01:58.299
His wife nodded and ran off.

25
00:01:58.300 --> 00:02:03.305
Soon she was back with a large hen.

26
00:02:03.306 --> 00:02:06.395
She put it in front of the ogre.

27
00:02:06.396 --> 00:02:09.725
The ogre grinned his nasty grin.

28
00:02:09.726 --> 00:02:35.816
"Hen, I want an egg!" the ogre cried. "Lay!"

29
00:02:35.817 --> 00:02:38.566
Jack's eyes opened wide.

30
00:02:38.567 --> 00:02:44.343
The hen laid a golden egg!

31
00:02:44.344 --> 00:02:48.891
"I must have that hen!" Jack thought.

